{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": "-- Grafana --",
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "Replica count 0→N (kube-state-metrics)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "pointSize": 5
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (deployment) (kube_deployment_status_replicas{deployment=~\"$app.*\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{deployment}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Replica count comes from kube-state-metrics (the CLUSTER), NOT from knext. Requires kube-state-metrics scraped by the same Prometheus. Knative revision Deployments are named <service>-<revision>-deployment; the regex matches the app."
    },
    {
      "title": "Pods that have paid a cold start",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count by (app) (knext_bunexec_startup_duration_seconds{app=~\"$app\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Each live pod recorded knext_bunexec_startup_duration_seconds exactly once, at the moment it bound its listeners. Under scale-to-zero every pod IS a cold start, so this counts them. (Was rate(knext_coldstart_total) - a counter from the retired node-server path; the compiled runtime does not emit it.)"
    },
    {
      "title": "Cold-start duration - median / worst (s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "pointSize": 5
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "quantile by (app) (0.5, knext_bunexec_startup_duration_seconds{app=~\"$app\"})",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "max by (app) (knext_bunexec_startup_duration_seconds{app=~\"$app\"})",
          "legendFormat": "max",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "description": "knext_bunexec_startup_duration_seconds is a gauge set ONCE per process (process.uptime() at listener bind), so the fleet distribution is already one sample per pod and quantile()/max() over the gauge is the correct aggregation - not histogram_quantile over buckets that do not exist."
    },
    {
      "title": "DB wake rate by role (/s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "pointSize": 5
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (role) (rate(knext_db_wake_total{app=~\"$app\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{role}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "NODE-LEGACY EMITTER: the knext db-wake series (knext_db_wake_total, knext_db_wake_duration_seconds) is registered by the APP (packages/kn-next/src/adapters/metrics.ts, wired from instrumentation) into a prom-client registry served on the APP port. The shipped PodMonitor scrapes :9464 only, so this panel is EMPTY unless you also scrape your app's /api/metrics route."
    },
    {
      "title": "DB wake latency p50 / p99 by role (s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "pointSize": 5
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, role) (rate(knext_db_wake_duration_seconds_bucket{app=~\"$app\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{role}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, role) (rate(knext_db_wake_duration_seconds_bucket{app=~\"$app\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99 {{role}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "description": "NODE-LEGACY EMITTER: the knext db-wake series (knext_db_wake_total, knext_db_wake_duration_seconds) is registered by the APP (packages/kn-next/src/adapters/metrics.ts, wired from instrumentation) into a prom-client registry served on the APP port. The shipped PodMonitor scrapes :9464 only, so this panel is EMPTY unless you also scrape your app's /api/metrics route."
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "style": "dark",
  "tags": ["knext", "scale-to-zero", "cold-start", "knative"],
